{
    "title": "ParkWhiz -- Parking App",
    "description": "Take the hassle out of parking with the ParkWhiz app. Find parking in any major city, compare prices, plus save up to 50% when you book in advance.\r\n\r\nNo more circling blocks worrying about finding a place to park.\r\n\r\nBusiness? Check. Commuting? Yep. Going to a museum or a concert? Got it. Need airport parking? Even there. Book with ParkWhiz for all of your parking needs.\r\n\r\nWe contract with garages and lots across America for insider pricing and pass that along to you. Here's how it works:\r\n\r\n- SEARCH thousands of locations across the nation\r\n- COMPARE pricing to find the best option\r\n- BOOK instantly\r\n- PARK with your mobile pass\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re the leading NYC app, sparing New Yorkers from alternate side of the street parking. From the most congested place in the nation, to Chicago, San Francisco, Boston, Los Angeles, Toronto and all points in between, ParkWhiz gets drivers parking for less. \r\n\r\nNeed help? We've got real people ready to assist. Our ace customer service folks will answer your call or text and get you on your way. \r\n\r\nCall or text 888-472-7594\r\nEmail info@parkwhiz.com\r\n\r\nTo find out more:\r\n\r\nFollow us on Twitter @ParkWhiz\r\nLike us on Facebook at http://facebook.com/parkwhiz\r\nLearn more at www.parkwhiz.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Take the hassle out of parking with the ParkWhiz app. Find parking in any major city, compare prices, plus save up to 50% when you book in advance.<br><br>No more circling blocks worrying about finding a place to park.<br><br>Business? Check. Commuting? Yep. Going to a museum or a concert? Got it. Need airport parking? Even there. Book with ParkWhiz for all of your parking needs.<br><br>We contract with garages and lots across America for insider pricing and pass that along to you. Here&#39;s how it works:<br><br>- SEARCH thousands of locations across the nation<br>- COMPARE pricing to find the best option<br>- BOOK instantly<br>- PARK with your mobile pass<br><br>We\u2019re the leading NYC app, sparing New Yorkers from alternate side of the street parking. From the most congested place in the nation, to Chicago, San Francisco, Boston, Los Angeles, Toronto and all points in between, ParkWhiz gets drivers parking for less. <br><br>Need help? We&#39;ve got real people ready to assist. Our ace customer service folks will answer your call or text and get you on your way. <br><br>Call or text 888-472-7594<br>Email info@parkwhiz.com<br><br>To find out more:<br><br>Follow us on Twitter @ParkWhiz<br>Like us on Facebook at http://facebook.com/parkwhiz<br>Learn more at www.parkwhiz.com",
